# The build context is sent to the daemon in full, and this repo carries
# gigabytes of run output that the image has no use for. "Files(3)" is NOT in
# here -- that is the IMAV arena, and course_world.py refuses to build without it.
.git
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.egg-info

runs
ckpt
data
data_manual
samples
sample
demo_gifs
demos.npz
notebooks
*.npz
*.mp4
*.gif
